      "source_sha256": "f7330cc524cb3b23",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I will break"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s15",
      "source_sha256": "39f7810ce049e34a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the hidden"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s16",
      "source_sha256": "ecf086e3c8875448",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "treasure I give to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s17",
      "source_sha256": "a58838cb72d709d8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I want you to understand holy mysteries, for I am the Lord who names you, the God of Israel. In this name, Cyrus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s18",
      "source_sha256": "38f70ae7180afaee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] is certainly Christ [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s19",
      "source_sha256": "39c77117a2e35e68",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] foretold [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s20",
      "source_sha256": "642d46242244776e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] before [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s21",
      "source_sha256": "33f2be5c07c6612a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] to whom the nations are [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s22",
      "source_sha256": "9652e8391c3d6f9e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and kingdoms bowed"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s23",
      "source_sha256": "89f1161be0295bfb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in faith. In no other way was there ever"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s24",
      "source_sha256": "b8c69b826e3ed31a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "any [?] in Israel [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s25",
      "source_sha256": "b2e0afb3043e62da",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] kingdom [?] named Cyrus"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s26",
      "source_sha256": "57738c791d83df70",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If, then, anyone believes that by Cyrus, king of the Persians,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s27",
      "source_sha256": "0a6093b73150ffc2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "this was foretold,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s28",
      "source_sha256": "a0a2ebf25fa71e00",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let him recognize"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s29",
      "source_sha256": "adfacb7b1a92afc1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that is absurd and heathenish for anyone to believe: that he, earlier,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s30",
      "source_sha256": "df86a2a6bfbd3ac0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a wicked man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s31",
      "source_sha256": "72864b8c005ac8b8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the heathen"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s32",
      "source_sha256": "be1aeccb86002aca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to idols"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s33",
      "source_sha256": "ef21c00ec78afeb9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "worshipper should be called Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s34",
      "source_sha256": "93c65ec59f740c02",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God and Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s35",
      "source_sha256": "ee55c7c3e5fc9e09",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "should have been so named. Concerning this, it is also not so written in the translation of the Seventy, \"to my Christ Cyrus\"; rather, they wrote:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s36",
      "source_sha256": "f276ba5275eac226",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"This said the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s37",
      "source_sha256": "b5e28446c11c6832",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to my Christ the Lord.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s38",
      "source_sha256": "1872b9a057134da8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And indeed that is"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s39",
      "source_sha256": "6685a3f70a224316",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "now undoubtedly clear"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s40",
      "source_sha256": "a1ef11b44dc76f7f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to understand"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s41",
      "source_sha256": "c38f30151e42d4fe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that this is said in"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s42",
      "source_sha256": "4a91c0aa8d42d2e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as the name of our Lord. If Christ is not God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s43",
      "source_sha256": "8e843ff5854327dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let the unbelievers now tell us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s44",
      "source_sha256": "2dbd7b169cba783a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to whom would God be"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s45",
      "source_sha256": "47f30dc061f64004",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "speaking"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s46",
      "source_sha256": "bd60b12345bdf319",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in Genesis, where"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s47",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s48",
      "source_sha256": "e0eab215e6843121",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "when he said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s49",
      "source_sha256": "72a2cec35f8e835f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Let us make man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s50",
      "source_sha256": "30c624ae85ab2df9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in our image"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s51",
      "source_sha256": "dea8a416aac682e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and in our likeness\"? As it is also said afterward there: \"And God created man in the image and likeness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s52",
      "source_sha256": "6e041b8b393ab8d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s53",
      "source_sha256": "3c2ad5fff629b447",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he made him.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s54",
      "source_sha256": "9a619af50742c5f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let them now seek, then, which God created, or in the likeness of which God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s55",
      "source_sha256": "328e1d09e98270d6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he made man in the image,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s56",
      "source_sha256": "3f03201618082101",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s57",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s58",
      "source_sha256": "38ef99c3b18307d1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "created. If they answer and say: \"in that of the angels,\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s59",
      "source_sha256": "229dbb89acc73c39",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "yet an angel is not equally like God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s1",
      "source_sha256": "080f25469e8a4bd0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] hand over them,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s2",
      "source_sha256": "b2aefffbe01fc9e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they will become plunder for those who previously served them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s3",
      "source_sha256": "a9aff89b24a9db07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and you shall know that the Lord of hosts has sent me.\" Now whose can this voice"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s4",
      "source_sha256": "013b5e1fbfe50dda",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to be, unless [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ba59b50a944841a1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the Savior"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s6",
      "source_sha256": "65230067912ad0a8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of the Lord, he, almighty God, made himself known to be sent"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s7",
      "source_sha256": "1c9153218ad0199a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "from the Almighty"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s8",
      "source_sha256": "a7cfb59abbc73e92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Father? So he was certainly sent to the peoples"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s9",
      "source_sha256": "74cc6f1b11a01622",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "according to his glorious divinity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s10",
      "source_sha256": "73dc6d1b02d0428f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which he together"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s11",
      "source_sha256": "4b980b75d546d739",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "with the Father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s12",
      "source_sha256": "dc03a2b27c343107",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When he humbled himself and a servant's form"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s13",
      "source_sha256": "48912e5c441b410f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "took on"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s14",
      "source_sha256": "660a2b73f2dabf00",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was made"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s15",
      "source_sha256": "29739358023b7f65",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "obedient"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s16",
      "source_sha256": "a17a5ff535509187",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "unto death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s17",
      "source_sha256": "68494321e829d62d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The same one also"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s18",
      "source_sha256": "ad1af851d1a97bf8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "hereafter, continuing, said: Praise and rejoice, daughter of Zion"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s19",
      "source_sha256": "ecc837af0ec85a22",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because, behold, I come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s20",
      "source_sha256": "3c9bd42bdcf0e175",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and in your midst"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s21",
      "source_sha256": "09b9f997a436c8f2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to dwell"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s22",
      "source_sha256": "03a9171c3bed751a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "said the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s23",
      "source_sha256": "101f92bf16263a2e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And on that day"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s24",
      "source_sha256": "c1f0916ebff392c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "many nations will be gathered"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s25",
      "source_sha256": "d4058bee35a8d624",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s26",
      "source_sha256": "543f84a1fe6c8574",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and they will become my people"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s27",
      "source_sha256": "33f693a1cb09d7f1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and I will dwell in your midst. And you will know"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s28",
      "source_sha256": "8098ad5ec21b3f66",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that the Lord of hosts has sent me to you. Who is"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s29",
      "source_sha256": "05c527af754f1bd7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "then now this Lord, sent by the Lord of hosts"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s30",
      "source_sha256": "1994fdd6b11f8ae0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "unless, again, the same Lord, the Savior Christ? Moreover, he is also"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s31",
      "source_sha256": "9d65d42b6a9ba358",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s32",
      "source_sha256": "845b795906e6ae14",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "from the Holy Spirit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s33",
      "source_sha256": "122665f05727ec95",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of whose divinity"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s34",
      "source_sha256": "51c08d9014b9d1ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and that"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s35",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s36",
      "source_sha256": "517fa26fb389ea25",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "is the Spirit of God, as he said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s37",
      "source_sha256": "6f025e770b8b49c7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Job:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s38",
      "source_sha256": "b039b241eb901f8c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s39",
      "source_sha256": "6b17da0fa9f4340c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me, and the breath of the Almighty gave me life.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s40",
      "source_sha256": "6fc2801e9d31a336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "\"Behold, God himself made me just as he made you.\" Concerning the same one of whom he had indeed said earlier: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s41",
      "source_sha256": "b1193b4651b5cf49",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "made me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s42",
      "source_sha256": "e372900aa6c7c4cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "This he moreover fastened"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s43",
      "source_sha256": "e2be16a602ffcac2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "to God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s44",
      "source_sha256": "0cffbf916e8c8596",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "there."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s45",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s46",
      "source_sha256": "06d9e6a55a1647f7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "After that he said: See, God also made me just as he made you, so that he might make known"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s47",
      "source_sha256": "1056d1d3f16d18e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "that the same Spirit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s48",
      "source_sha256": "303f6ac46fead4db",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "is God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s49",
      "source_sha256": "9a4125df0238a497",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Here it speaks about the signification of the three Persons of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s50",
      "source_sha256": "96320d6fcbaf5a07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "It is shown"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s51",
      "source_sha256": "3c88d080dbca2179",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "in the books of the Old Testament that the Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s52",
      "source_sha256": "581c3544aad68db2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and that the Son and the Holy Spirit are God; but of this are unbelieving"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s53",
      "source_sha256": "ee44345f95200642",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "the Jewish people,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s54",
      "source_sha256": "d01121a4b238988b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "that the Son and the Holy Spirit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s55",
      "source_sha256": "89d6fafe64e2474a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "are God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s1",
      "source_sha256": "6fd56d528d718b24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And will be"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s2",
      "source_sha256": "a137f17a19a09cbe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "[?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e89a2fb74b024c1b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "name"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4b1dab3229477d54",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "called"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s5",
      "source_sha256": "780e90ee5b5a6c92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s6",
      "source_sha256": "6627d204ea18159c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "of those inclined toward it [?] multiplied;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s7",
      "source_sha256": "3c9084e5bdf9275e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "will be his"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s8",
      "source_sha256": "33b2f0fc65f7b062",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "command. The prophet: certainly was born; not for himself, when he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s9",
      "source_sha256": "e7c0647f1cc9d84f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "became man,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s10",
      "source_sha256": "3d56e5ae6147a118",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "having become"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9bc5758de1c984f2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "to us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s12",
      "source_sha256": "bfc0399fee77a5cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "born."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s13",
      "source_sha256": "75bd15c00d3c59f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-07",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "A son, moreover, if not the Son of God? His dominion, because he [?] on his own [?], because Pilate wrote the title of his [?] on his head."
    }
  ]
}
